WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.169 --> 00:00:03.569
-Football is back!
But, uh, it is --

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:07.206
There's actually this one tiny
thing that's been on my mind

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:09.742
about the NFL, so I decided
to write a song about it.

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:12.345
Now, if you don't mind, Roots,
can I get a beat?

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:13.913
[ Roots playing funky beat ]

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:18.451
♪♪

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:34.634
So, what's up with Raiders owner
Mark Davis' haircut?

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.070
[ Laughter ]
-Oh!

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.238
-Bro!

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:56.489
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:00.727
Get it off my chest.
Thank you, Roots.

